cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the analyses it contains, please cite it as below."
title: "Cross-dataset generalization in HCC tumour segmentation: code and analysis"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying a three-architecture study of cross-dataset generalization in
  hepatocellular carcinoma tumour segmentation. Convolutional (nnU-Net ResEnc-M),
  state-space (U-Mamba Bot) and transformer (SwinUNETR) models are trained on a
  single HCC cohort under identical splits and applied without adaptation to two
  independent external cohorts. Includes data preparation, training configurations,
  external evaluation, case-level concordance, lesion-volume stratification,
  calibration, selective prediction, anatomical constraint and ensemble analyses.
type: software
